### W06，先在本机设置变量；真实Token只在HTTP客户端会话内，不保存回仓库。
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@orgID = 1
@documentID = 1
@token = REPLACE_LOCALLY_WITH_IN_MEMORY_TOKEN

### 前置：文档已上传并成功提取READY。索引调用不发送body。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents/{{documentID}}/index
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 独立索引状态；没有记录时200 ABSENT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/documents/{{documentID}}/index
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 精确组织内检索
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"数据库连接超时应该先检查什么？","top_k":5}

### 非流式回答；来源只有经过校验的chunk
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"数据库连接超时应该先检查什么？","top_k":5}

### 预期400，top_k只能是1..10的JSON整数
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{orgID}}/knowledge/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"数据库","top_k":0}
